docs: clear the wording findings and settle the semicolons

26 semicolons in 3.9k characters. Bullets take a comma, paragraphs take
a full stop, so no bullet grew past two sentences.

Also: 取不到 becomes 无法获取, 读不到 becomes 无法读取, and the handover
section is split into what happens and how the token is confirmed first.

Four term-casing warnings remain on purpose: dsh, web, agent and fleet
appear lowercase as command and profile names (dsh web, web profile,
fleet bearer) and capitalised as product names.
